l,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":"Pathfinder Bestiary"},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-family-ability-glossary.Item.unR8VVR4yyRnsmnB","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"WdBzt8POExfI1F77","name":"Final Howl","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The hearth hound is reduced to 0 HP;</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The hearth hound uses Sorrow's Howl. The point of origin for this effect is the hearth hound's hearth. The hearth hound is then destroyed.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"61jjpU7O6ah1NwLd","name":"Breath Weapon","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The hearth hound exhales ash and flames, dealing [[/r 5d6[fire]]] damage to creatures in a @Template[type:cone|distance:15] (@Check[type:reflex|dc:20|name:Breath Weapon DC|traits:damaging-effect,divine, evocation, fire|showDC:gm]{basic Reflex} save). The area is filled with a cloud of smoke for 2 rounds. Creatures within the smoke are @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}, and all other creatures are concealed to them. The hearth hound can't use Breath Weapon again for [[/br 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine","fire"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"aCGkJwavMXKAU1rT","name":"Sorrow's Howl","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The hearth hound howls mournfully, communicating all the loss and pain it has seen during its time at the hearth. This howl is audible up to 100 feet away. Any creature that hears the howl must attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:21|name:Sorrow's Howl DC|traits:auditory, divine, emotion, enchantment, mental|showDC:gm]{Will} save. Regardless of the result, the creature is then temporarily immune to Sorrow's Howl for 24 hours.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 round as it sobs uncontrollably.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is slowed 1 for [[/r 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds} and cannot use reactions as long as it is slowed.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the duration is 1 minute.</p>\n"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","divine","emotion","mental"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"aIbMNgKvJW0lmxEX","name":"Flaming Jaws","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["finesse","magical"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"Va3VmAuRiFOMXwko":{"damage":"1d6+7","damageType":"void"},"QBZrZSmHhUrRJ8oC":{"damage":"1d6","damageType":"fire"}},"bonus":{"value":14},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":1721533003224,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"pf2e":{"lootable":false},"core":{}},"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":45,"temp":0,"max":45,"details":"negative healing, rejuvination"},"ac":{"value":20,"details":"","base":20},"allSaves":{"value":"+2 status to all saves vs. mental"},"speed":{"value":0,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","label":"Fly","value":30}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"death-effects"},{"type":"disease"},{"type":"fire"},{"type":"mental"},{"type":"paralyzed"},{"type":"poison"},{"type":"precision"},{"type":"unconscious"}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"cold","value":5}],"resistances":[{"type":"all-damage","value":5,"exceptions":["force","ghost-touch","vitality"],"doubleVs":["non-magical"]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":[],"details":""},"level":{"value":4},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Few can wish for a more peaceful death than in one's sleep before the warmth of the family fireplace. When a cherished canine companion so peacefully passes away after spending its entire life with one family in one home, the spirit of the hound might linger within the embers and ashes of the hearth. Here the spirit remains, guarding its former home and family even after death, sometimes lingering in the home for a century or more in order to watch over its original family's children and grandchildren.</p>\n<p>In its dormant form, this spirit is detectable as little more the feeling of warmth, contentment, and peace that radiates from the hearth; thus, a family might remain unaware of a hearth hound's existence for years or even decades. However, once the hearth hound senses a threat against its wards, such as a violent burglar, an arsonist, or even simply an exploitative tax collector, the beast instantly manifests from the flames of the family hearth to defend its loved ones.</p>\n<h2>Rare Guardians</h2>\n<p>It is impossible to intentionally create or summon a hearth hound, and those who actively seek protection from one rarely receive it. Only by cherishing and caring for a dog throughout its entire life can a family hope to be blessed by this guardian spirit.</p>\n<h2>Loyal Protectors</h2>\n<p>In its manifested form, a hearth hound resembles a plume of living ash in the shape of a giant dog, casting light from the glowing embers of its eyes and emitting a deep rumbling growl that shakes the foundations of the house. A hearth hound bravely protects its family from attackers and chases away threats, loyal to the very end.</p>\n<h2>Monster Part Subsystem</h2>\n<p><strong>Hearth Hound Creature 4 </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 12/27/50 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> armor (light), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Stealth)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, charisma, dexterity, energy resistant (acid, electricity, fire, negative, sonic), fire, fortification, mental, negative, sensory (darkvision, scent), wild, winged</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary","authors":"Jeremy Corff","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":-5},"dex":{"mod":4},"con":{"mod":0},"int":{"mod":-3},"wis":{"mod":3},"cha":{"mod":5}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":13,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"type":"scent","acuity":"imprecise","range":30}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":10,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":14,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":13,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":12},"athletics":{"base":11},"stealth":{"base":12}},"traits":{"value":["beast","incorporeal","spirit","undead"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"med"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"prototypeToken":{"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":true}},"height":1,"width":1,"disposition":-1,"name":"Hearth Hound","actor